{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"778f4f847b989a8308c1d48632b3a042da6fd3fdf39b37d498bd5c2574c2d6ff","ja":"う、うんっ……！\nえっと……ニジュウサン、ニジュウシ……。","zh":"嗯、嗯……！\n那个……二十三、二十四……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"a57c5b72c0dd287f1a231e2884040235e2e3741d892675452a6633e541494fef","ja":"そうですね、とても。……ところで未来。\nどうしてスクワットなんてしてるの……？","zh":"是啊，非常棒。……不过话说回来，未来。\n你为什么在做深蹲啊……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fd6df31eed75c735925444c0092df23441f0958fac7e781d201f6b87b929b13e","ja":"鍛錬でしたら、劇場に戻ってからでも\nいいのではないでしょうか？","zh":"如果是锻炼的话，回剧场之后再进行\n不是也可以吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"9893e2e6e6ead29794972c35c7e6c0ce1ccac66e17b39f56d452a3e5c081f5ea","ja":"……サンジュウっと。ふぅ……。\n時間があるときは、筋トレしないとって！","zh":"……三十。呼……。\n一有空闲，就得做肌肉锻炼才行呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"42ee5889045b1d12ab4cb9ec0c0bf4a0cd42de4c3f3c36b0a03232717df71760","ja":"今度、山で映画の撮影をすることになったんだ。\nだから体づくりしなきゃで。","zh":"下次要去山里拍电影了。\n所以得好好锻炼身体才行。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"a40aceca783b3cd9d0d6c508fc2d037256d7e49985c8aff04daf38e6ade4ae6b","ja":"えらい！　足が疲れちゃったら、\nせっかくの山登りの楽しみが、減っちゃうもんね！","zh":"真了不起！要是脚走累了，\n难得登山的乐趣可就要减半了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"be6b21ed29fe764e53142f40d18923e942914d57a15d0729854f869563bbf504","ja":"それにしても、未来ちゃん、\nなんだか今回はいつも以上に、気合いが入ってるね？","zh":"话又说回来，未来，\n总觉得你这次比平时还要干劲十足呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"afd03f411dbd83b6d9b569c914ae82e520152a866438730fa44d2bd41455fffb","ja":"えへへ、バレちゃった？　この役、\n監督さんが、ぜひ私にって、言ってくれたの。","zh":"嘿嘿，被发现了吗？这个角色，\n是导演说一定要让我来演的哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"6ba4ff5993c8d9f7fef1a6d097fcf4b352beac60772ffa03fa3ddeafeed22cf0","ja":"私のこれまでのお仕事を見て、任せたいと思って\nくれたんだって！　だから、期待に応えたくて！","zh":"说是看了我以往的工作，觉得可以放心交给我呢！\n所以，我很想回应他们的期待！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"fa0255f695a177fec75859373872cb2cd40ca123b9d8d6c62424d72cdd86ea49","ja":"ふふっ。映画の主演を引き受けた時の\nなるさんみたいですね。","zh":"呵呵。就像接下了电影主演时的\n鸣小姐一样呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"6af20be09aef8c4002decc12fe7b35d79c87ebe456cb366690b29c6c5a79514f","ja":"そういうことでしたら、\n私にもぜひ、お手伝いさせてください！","zh":"既然是这样的话，\n也请务必让我来帮忙！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"9cd3fea45e37a9f0fa0ec9513b12127786b2d03520f57824e2fe5d420d11d6db","ja":"そうね。私もできる限りサポートするわ。","zh":"也是呢。我也会尽可能提供协助的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"2dfe39aee53380aeefd9e4079bd2581d32d143872c34bb357422aec836d3d860","ja":"もちろん、私も！\n山のことなら、いくらでも聞いてくれていいからね♪","zh":"当然，我也一样！\n关于登山的事，尽管向我打听就好啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1505.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"c1964af3ae89afb2dfe213e609b9a96727ce672a59b409973de2fe47e5310f88","ja":"みんな……ありがとう！\nよろしくお願いしますっ！","zh":"大家……谢谢你们！\n请多关照啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
